===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|industry}}, {{m|enm|industrie}}, from {{der|en|fro|industrie}}, from {{der|en|la|industria|t=diligence, activity, industry}}, from {{m|la|industrius|t=diligent, active, zealous}}, from {{der|en|itc-ola|indostruus|t=diligent, active}}; origin unknown. Perhaps from {{m|la|indu||in}} + {{m|la||ūst-, ūstr-}}, stem of {{m|la|ūrō||pos=verb|burn, burn up, consume}}, related to {{cog|goh|ūstrī||industry}}, {{cog|ang|andūstrian||to hate, detest|lit=to be consumed with zeal}}.

